---
import BlogLayout from '../../layouts/BlogLayout.astro';
---

<BlogLayout title="關於我們 — Ovis Shop" description="Ovis Shop 商城理念：物品流轉、惜物共享、綠色循環。">
  <div class="main-content">
    <div class="container">
      <!-- 麵包屑導航 -->
      <div class="breadcrumbs">
        <a href="/" class="home">首頁</a>
        <span class="sep">&gt;</span>
        <a href="/shop/">Ovis Shop</a>
        <span class="sep">&gt;</span>
        <span class="current-post-name">關於我們</span>
      </div>

      <!-- 🔷 1. Hero Header -->
      <section class="content-hero-header">
        <div class="left">
          <h3>Ovis Shop</h3>
          <h2>物品價值，淋漓盡致</h2>
          <a href="/shop/products/" class="btn-about-hero">瀏覽全部商品</a>
        </div>
        <div class="right">
          <div class="slider-wrap-header">
            <div class="slider-one">
              <div class="img-wrap">
                <div class="bgs bgs1"></div>
                <div class="bgs bgs2"></div>
                <div class="bgs bgs3"></div>
                <div class="bgs bgs4"></div>
                <a class="bgs bgs5 hero-featured-link" href="/shop/products/">
                  <div class="featured-img-container">
                    <img src="/banners/hero-promo-v3.jpg?v=20260820light" alt="Ovis Shop" class="featured-main-img" />
                  </div>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 📰 2. 雙欄主內容區 -->
      <div class="content-area-top">
        <div class="left">
          <!-- 📑 商城快捷分頁分類標籤 -->
          <div class="tech-main-tab-bar">
            <div class="tech-main-tabs">
              <a href="/shop/products/" class="tech-main-tab-item">全部商品</a>
              <a href="/shop/shopping-guide/" class="tech-main-tab-item">購物須知</a>
              <a href="/shop/about/" class="tech-main-tab-item active">關於我們</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="post-area-head">
            <h2 class="post-area-title">關於 Ovis Shop</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="guide-content-box">
            <section class="guide-section">
              <h3 class="guide-h3">我們的理念</h3>
              <p><strong>「物品價值，淋漓盡致」</strong> — 這是 Ovis Shop 的核心初衷。</p>
              <p>每一件科技硬體與實用物資在製造時都凝聚了地球的資源與工程師的心血。我們相信，功能完好的硬體不該因為被升級換代而隨意閒置或浪費。Ovis Shop 致力於提供一個透明、乾淨且受嚴格檢測的物資流轉平台，讓優質良品找到需要它的新主人，實現循環永續。</p>
            </section>

            <section class="guide-section">
              <h3 class="guide-h3">嚴格檢測與品質把關</h3>
              <p>在 Ovis Shop 上架的每一件電腦周邊、零組件與科技配件，皆由站長親自進行實機運行測試與功能校驗，確保功能完全正常後才進行防撞包裝與上架流轉，提供清晰可靠的透明選購體驗。</p>
            </section>

            <section class="guide-section">
              <h3 class="guide-h3">聯絡站長</h3>
              <p>若您對商品狀況、訂單有任何疑問，或有優質良品想進行交流，歡迎隨時透過 Email 與我們聯絡：<a href="mailto:hi@nasirlin.net" style="color:#ff6b00;">hi@nasirlin.net</a></p>
            </section>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 📌 右側側邊欄 -->
        <aside class="right sidebar-right">
          <div class="side-author-box">
            <div class="photo">
              <img src="/sheep-hd.png" alt="Ovis Shop" width="90" height="90" />
            </div>
            <h2>Ovis Shop <span class="eng-name">/ 商城精選</span></h2>
            <p class="history">物品流轉 · 惜物共享 · 綠色循環</p>
            <div class="side-btn-wrap">
              <a href="/shop/about/" class="btn-vip">商城理念</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BlogLayout>

<style is:global>
  .main-content {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 1.5rem 0 5rem;
  }

  .breadcrumbs {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #999999;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .breadcrumbs a {
    color: #666666;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .breadcrumbs a:hover {
    color: #ff6b00;
  }

  .breadcrumbs .sep {
    margin: 0 5px;
    color: #cccccc;
  }

  .breadcrumbs .current-post-name {
    color: #333333;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .content-hero-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: stretch;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e2e2;
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .content-hero-header .left {
    width: 28%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding-right: 2rem;
  }

  .content-hero-header .left h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #ff6b00;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .content-hero-header .left h2 {
    font-size: 1.65rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #111111;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .btn-about-hero {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.4rem;
    background: #111111;
    color: #ffffff !important;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    align-self: flex-start;
    transition: background 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-about-hero:hover {
    background: #ff6b00;
  }

  .content-hero-header .right {
    width: 70%;
  }

  .slider-wrap-header {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .slider-one .img-wrap {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    max-height: 380px;
    background: #f0f0f0;
  }

  .hero-featured-link {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .featured-img-container {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .featured-main-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .content-area-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .content-area-top > .left {
    width: 68%;
    padding-right: 3.5%;
    border-right: 1px solid #e2e2e2;
  }

  .content-area-top > .right.sidebar-right {
    width: 28%;
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .tech-main-tab-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #111111;
    padding-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .tech-main-tabs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .tech-main-tab-item {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #888888;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .tech-main-tab-item:hover,
  .tech-main-tab-item.active {
    color: #111111;
  }

  .post-area-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #111111;
    padding-bottom: 0.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
  }

  .post-area-title {
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #111111;
    border-left: 5px solid #ff6b00;
    padding-left: 12px;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .guide-content-box {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    padding: 2.2rem 2.4rem;
  }

  .guide-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }

  .guide-h3 {
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin: 0;
    border-left: 3px solid #ff6b00;
    padding-left: 10px;
  }

  .guide-content-box p {
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    color: #475569;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .side-author-box {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
    padding: 1.8rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .side-author-box .photo img {
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .side-author-box h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
    color: #111111;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .side-author-box .history {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #888888;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .side-author-box .btn-vip {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.4rem 1.2rem;
    background: #111111;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .content-hero-header {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .content-hero-header .left {
      width: 100%;
      padding-right: 0;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .content-hero-header .right {
      width: 100%;
    }
    .content-area-top {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    .content-area-top > .left {
      width: 100%;
      padding-right: 0;
      border-right: none;
    }
    .content-area-top > .right.sidebar-right {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
